@{ ViewData["Title"] = "開發展示"; }
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/showcase.css" asp-append-version="true" />
<section class="showcase-shell">
    <header class="showcase-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> AEVRYND / DEVELOPMENT ATLAS · 2026.09</p>
        <h1>從第一個世界，<em>走向完整遊戲引擎。</em></h1>
        <p>Aevrynd 是持續演進的原生 2D／2.5D／3D 遊戲引擎。最新同鏡位驗收已讓完整 Demo（可執行遊戲展示）由 34／100 提升至 40／100；近期仍優先改善人物、動作、場景與光影，目標至少 70／100。此頁區分歷史發布、已驗證切片與開發中（WIP）；技術驗收門檻（gate）通過不等於畫面達標。</p>
        <div class="truth-strip" aria-label="目前發布狀態">
            <div><small>VISUAL SCORE</small><strong>40 / 100</strong><span class="status-no">基準 34，增加 6；尚未達 70</span></div>
            <div><small>GAMEPLAY DEMO</small><strong>v1.3.0</strong><span>目前已發布；品質不代表現況目標</span></div>
            <div><small>NEXT RELEASE</small><strong>v1.4</strong><span class="status-no">尚未發布</span></div>
            <div><small>RENDER PATH</small><strong>D3D12</strong><span>跨 Vulkan／Metal 等價尚未證明</span></div>
        </div>
    </header>


    <nav class="atlas-nav" aria-label="展示章節">
        <a href="#demo-motion">01 歷史影片</a><a href="#visual-progress-title">02 拖曳比較</a><a href="#interactive-demo-title">03 互動實機</a><a href="#release-title">04 版本演進</a><a href="#heroine-title">05 原創女主角 WIP</a><a href="#system-title">06 三機協作</a><a href="#engine-title">07 引擎架構</a><a href="#glossary-title">08 名詞中文對照</a>
    </nav>
    <section id="demo-motion" class="showcase-section motion-section" aria-labelledby="motion-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="micro-label">ENGINE IN MOTION</p><h2 id="motion-title">四段影片看見開發演進</h2><p>四支影片皆由可追溯的實機擷取影格製作：兩支回顧歷史版本，兩支呈現目前 40 分的九鏡頭與角色步行測試。它們是測試影格導覽，不是連續遊玩錄影；來源與雜湊可由媒體清單核對。</p></div>
        <div class="motion-grid">
            <article class="motion-card">
                <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/development/gameplay-evolution.jpg" aria-label="Gameplay Lab v1.1 至 v1.3 歷史實機截圖動畫導覽"><source src="/media/development/gameplay-evolution.mp4" type="video/mp4" />你的瀏覽器不支援此影片。</video>
                <div><span class="micro-label">GAMEPLAY LAB / 01</span><h3>走進遊戲世界</h3><p>v1.1 → v1.2 → v1.3。比較第三人稱日間場景；保留原版本的呈現與限制。</p><span class="motion-label">歷史實機截圖動畫導覽 · 非連續遊玩錄影</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="motion-card">
                <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/development/engine-evolution.jpg" aria-label="Engine Lab v2.51 至 v2.55 歷史實機截圖動畫導覽"><source src="/media/development/engine-evolution.mp4" type="video/mp4" />你的瀏覽器不支援此影片。</video>
                <div><span class="micro-label">ENGINE LAB / 02</span><h3>讓世界持續運行</h3><p>分區載入 → 世界原點重定位 → 增量保存 → 網路複寫 → 級聯陰影。</p><span class="motion-label">歷史實機截圖動畫導覽 · 非連續遊玩錄影</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="motion-card">
                <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/development/visual-score-40-first-day.png" aria-label="40 分第一人稱、第三人稱與上帝視角日暮夜九鏡頭測試影片"><source src="/media/development/visual-score-40-nine-shot-tour.mp4" type="video/mp4" />你的瀏覽器不支援此影片。</video>
                <div><span class="micro-label">VISUAL 40 / 03</span><h3>九個固定鏡頭巡覽</h3><p>第一人稱、第三人稱與上帝視角各自切換日間、黃昏與夜間，完整呈現 40 分驗收矩陣。</p><span class="motion-label">九鏡頭測試影格影片 · 非連續遊玩錄影</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="motion-card">
                <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/development/character-f2-walk-0.png" aria-label="F2 角色八幀同鏡位步行測試影片"><source src="/media/development/character-f2-walk-cycle.mp4" type="video/mp4" />你的瀏覽器不支援此影片。</video>
                <div><span class="micro-label">CHARACTER / 04</span><h3>逐幀檢查步行週期</h3><p>將八張同鏡位角色測試影格循環播放，方便觀察腳步相位、身體重心與姿勢連續性。</p><span class="motion-label">八幀步行測試影片 · 非即時角色動畫</span></div>
            </article>
        </div>
        <p class="evidence-note">四支播放器都提供播放、暫停、進度與全螢幕控制，且不自動播放。<a href="/media/development/media-manifest.json">檢視媒體來源清單</a>。最新完整遊戲視覺為 40 / 100，v1.4 仍未發布。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="showcase-section visual-progress" aria-labelledby="visual-progress-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="micro-label">SAME-CAMERA VISUAL EVIDENCE</p>
            <h2 id="visual-progress-title">權威視覺分數：34 → 40</h2>
            <p>使用同一組 1280×720 Normal 模式鏡位比較；拖曳分隔線可在 34 分基準與引擎提交 <code>d6e0976</code> 的 40 分結果間擦拭。這四張圖是目前來源的實機擷取，不是生成概念圖，也不是 v1.4 發布畫面。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="score-breakdown" aria-label="40 分視覺評分明細">
            <div><span>構圖</span><strong>9 / 20</strong></div>
            <div><span>人物</span><strong>4 / 20</strong></div>
            <div><span>材質</span><strong>8 / 15</strong></div>
            <div><span>燈光</span><strong>7 / 15</strong></div>
            <div><span>場景完整度</span><strong>8 / 20</strong></div>
            <div><span>技術缺陷</span><strong>4 / 10</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="visual-pair-grid">
            <article class="visual-pair">
                <header><span>GOD / DAY</span><h3>上帝視角：聚落密度與建築可讀性</h3></header>
                <div class="comparison-wipe" data-comparison style="--reveal:50%">
                    <img class="comparison-before" src="/media/development/visual-score-34-god-day.png" alt="34 分基準的上帝視角日間實機擷取" loading="lazy" />
                    <div class="comparison-after"><img src="/media/development/visual-score-40-god-day.png" alt="40 分結果的上帝視角日間實機擷取" loading="lazy" /></div>
                    <span class="comparison-label comparison-label-before">之前 · 34</span><span class="comparison-label comparison-label-after">現在 · 40</span><span class="comparison-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </div>
                <label class="comparison-control">拖曳比較上帝視角：<output data-comparison-output>50% 顯示新版</output><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" data-comparison-range aria-label="調整上帝視角新版畫面的顯示比例" /></label>
                <p class="comparison-copy">新版加入 35 株四象限近景地被，以及門窗、屋簷、踏階與煙囪。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="visual-pair">
                <header><span>THIRD PERSON / DAY</span><h3>第三人稱：地表層次與材質</h3></header>
                <div class="comparison-wipe" data-comparison style="--reveal:50%">
                    <img class="comparison-before" src="/media/development/visual-score-34-third-day.png" alt="34 分基準的第三人稱日間實機擷取" loading="lazy" />
                    <div class="comparison-after"><img src="/media/development/visual-score-40-third-day.png" alt="40 分結果的第三人稱日間實機擷取" loading="lazy" /></div>
                    <span class="comparison-label comparison-label-before">之前 · 34</span><span class="comparison-label comparison-label-after">現在 · 40</span><span class="comparison-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </div>
                <label class="comparison-control">拖曳比較第三人稱：<output data-comparison-output>50% 顯示新版</output><input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" data-comparison-range aria-label="調整第三人稱新版畫面的顯示比例" /></label>
                <p class="comparison-copy">新版提高近景草地密度，並補強建築材質細節。</p>
            </article>
        </div>
        <div class="visual-matrix-heading"><span class="micro-label">CURRENT 40 / 9-SHOT MATRIX</span><h3>再比較三種視角與日、暮、夜</h3><p>下列九張皆來自同一個已驗證來源與同一輪 Normal 擷取。這裡比較的是 40 分候選在不同視角與時段的穩定性；只有上方 God／day 與 Third／day 具備 34 分同鏡位基準。</p></div>
        <div class="visual-matrix" aria-label="40 分三視角與日暮夜九鏡頭比較">
            @foreach (var shot in new[] {
                new { View = "first", Time = "day", Label = "第一人稱 · 日間" }, new { View = "first", Time = "dusk", Label = "第一人稱 · 黃昏" }, new { View = "first", Time = "night", Label = "第一人稱 · 夜間" },
                new { View = "third", Time = "day", Label = "第三人稱 · 日間" }, new { View = "third", Time = "dusk", Label = "第三人稱 · 黃昏" }, new { View = "third", Time = "night", Label = "第三人稱 · 夜間" },
                new { View = "god", Time = "day", Label = "上帝視角 · 日間" }, new { View = "god", Time = "dusk", Label = "上帝視角 · 黃昏" }, new { View = "god", Time = "night", Label = "上帝視角 · 夜間" }
            }) {
                var source = $"/media/development/visual-score-40-{shot.View}-{shot.Time}.png";
                <button type="button" data-lightbox-src="@source" data-lightbox-alt="40 分 @shot.Label 固定鏡頭實機擷取"><img src="@source" alt="40 分 @shot.Label 固定鏡頭實機擷取" loading="lazy" /><span>@shot.Label</span></button>
            }
        </div>
        <div class="visual-truth-grid">
            <article><strong>已改善</strong><p>聚落近景草地、建築門窗框、深色玻璃、窗台、踏階、屋簷與煙囪；場景完整度與材質分項上升。</p></article>
            <article><strong>仍需修正</strong><p>M2 男性角色頭髮仍有尖刺；God 鏡位仍有巨型遮擋物、世界邊緣空洞與左上除錯文字，因此人物分項沒有增加。</p></article>
            <article><strong>驗收證據</strong><p>Fresh Release <code>ALL_BUILD</code>、focused 5／5、Normal 250.03 秒、GBV 109.98 秒；GPU debug errors／warnings 0／0，完整 11-shot 通過。</p></article>
        </div>
        <p class="evidence-note">獨立同鏡位評分為 40／100，較基準增加 6 分。這是已驗證的重大進展，但仍是 WIP；未達 70／100，v1.4 未發布。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="showcase-section interactive-demo" aria-labelledby="interactive-demo-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="micro-label">INTERACTIVE CAPTURE EXPLORER</p><h2 id="interactive-demo-title">切換視角、時段與角色步行幀</h2><p>全部內容皆來自提交 <code>d6e0976</code> 的固定測試擷取。場景輪播是 9 張固定鏡頭序列；角色播放是 8 張同鏡位步行測試幀。它們不是連續遊玩錄影。</p></div>
        <div class="interactive-grid">
            <article class="capture-explorer" data-scene-explorer>
                <header><span class="micro-label">SCENE / 9 VERIFIED SHOTS</span><h3>場景視角與三時段</h3></header>
                <div class="capture-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="選擇場景視角">
                    <span>視角</span><button type="button" data-scene-view="first" aria-pressed="true">第一人稱</button><button type="button" data-scene-view="third" aria-pressed="false">第三人稱</button><button type="button" data-scene-view="god" aria-pressed="false">上帝視角</button>
                </div>
                <div class="capture-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="選擇場景時段">
                    <span>時段</span><button type="button" data-scene-time="day" aria-pressed="true">日間</button><button type="button" data-scene-time="dusk" aria-pressed="false">黃昏</button><button type="button" data-scene-time="night" aria-pressed="false">夜間</button><button type="button" class="capture-play" data-scene-play aria-pressed="false">播放三時段</button>
                </div>
                <figure class="capture-stage"><img src="/media/development/visual-score-40-first-day.png" alt="第一人稱日間固定鏡頭實機擷取" loading="lazy" data-scene-image /><figcaption data-scene-caption aria-live="polite">第一人稱 · 日間 · 固定鏡頭 1／9</figcaption></figure>
                <p class="capture-disclosure">自動播放只輪替日間、黃昏、夜間三張固定畫面；切換視角可查看同一驗收矩陣的其他鏡位。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="character-sequence" data-character-sequence>
                <header><span class="micro-label">CHARACTER / 8 TEST FRAMES</span><h3>F2 同鏡位步行週期</h3></header>
                <figure class="capture-stage character-stage"><img src="/media/development/character-f2-walk-0.png" alt="F2 步行測試第 1 幀，共 8 幀" loading="lazy" data-character-image /><figcaption data-character-caption aria-live="polite">測試幀 1／8</figcaption></figure>
                <div class="frame-controls"><button type="button" data-character-prev aria-label="上一個步行測試幀">上一幀</button><button type="button" data-character-play aria-pressed="false">播放逐幀</button><button type="button" data-character-next aria-label="下一個步行測試幀">下一幀</button></div>
                <label class="frame-scrubber">步行測試幀 <output data-character-output>1 / 8</output><input type="range" min="0" max="7" value="0" step="1" data-character-range aria-label="選擇 F2 步行測試幀" /></label>
                <p class="capture-disclosure">這是 Character Visual Quality 測試產生的 8 張同鏡位影像，可逐幀檢查姿勢變化；不是即時動畫或遊玩影片。播放器預設暫停，避免造成不必要動態。</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="showcase-section" aria-labelledby="release-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="micro-label">TRACEABLE RELEASES</p><h2 id="release-title">可追溯 Demo 與發布切片</h2><p>只有狀態帳與功能目錄明確附帶版本、來源或驗證契約者列為發布證據。磁碟中的其他舊目錄僅是歷史產物。</p></div>
        <div class="showcase-filters" role="group" aria-label="Demo 狀態篩選"><button type="button" data-release-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button><button type="button" data-release-filter="released" aria-pressed="false">已發布</button><button type="button" data-release-filter="historical" aria-pressed="false">歷史／不合格</button></div>
        <div class="release-grid">
            <article class="release-card release-current" tabindex="0" data-release-state="released" data-detail-title="Engine Lab v2.55" data-detail="已發布的四級級聯與接觸陰影驗收切片；效能、記憶體與 immutable release 有獨立 receipt，但不代表完整全域光照或 UE5 等價。"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.55 · 四級陰影</h3><p>4×2048 CSM、contact shadow、113/113 suite；immutable tree 134 files。</p><code>v2.55.0-engine-v2.86.0-c033de38</code></article>
            <article class="release-card" tabindex="0" data-release-state="released" data-detail-title="Engine Lab v2.53" data-detail="Dirty Delta V2 以 snapshot 與 journal mirror 保存 building、vegetation 與 terrain edits；這仍不是 server-authoritative MMO persistence。"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.53 · Dirty Delta</h3><p>大型世界增量持久化、95/95 tests、GPU validation 8、6 captures。</p><code>v2.53.0-engine-v2.86.0-73f10a96</code></article>
            <article class="release-card" tabindex="0" data-release-state="released" data-detail-title="Engine Lab v2.52" data-detail="以 int64 chunk 與 local offset 建立大型世界座標，並用兩階段交易同步 ECS、physics、navigation、camera 與 renderer。"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.52 · Origin Rebase</h3><p>int64 global position 與跨系統 frame-boundary transaction；89/89 tests。</p><code>v2.52.0-engine-v2.86.0-e1584944</code></article>
            <article class="release-card" tabindex="0" data-release-state="released" data-detail-title="Engine Lab v2.51" data-detail="World Partition 驗收版本展示分區 prepare、activate、retire 與資源 lease；完整 world streaming 仍持續演進。"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.51 · World Partition</h3><p>分區載入驗收切片；81/81 tests、GPU validation 與 5 captures。</p><code>v2.51.0-engine-v2.86.0-4568daa1</code></article>
            <article class="release-card" tabindex="0" data-release-state="released" data-detail-title="Character Lab v2.10" data-detail="Character immutable release 具 latest 與 pinned launcher 擷取證據；它是角色管線驗收，不代表 Gameplay Lab 的整體視覺品質。"><span>CHARACTER LAB</span><h3>v2.10 · Character</h3><p>Immutable Character release；latest 與 pinned launcher 完成 12/12 擷取。</p><code>v2.10.0-engine-v2.86.0-27ea58cd</code></article>
            <article class="release-card release-warning" tabindex="0" data-release-state="historical" data-detail-title="Gameplay Lab v1.3" data-detail="此版本可追溯且已發布，但使用者已判定不合格。它不得作為現況畫質或 v1.4 發布資格的證據。"><span>GAMEPLAY LAB</span><h3>v1.3 · 歷史發布</h3><p>目前最新已發布 Gameplay Demo，但已被判定不合格，不可作為目前品質代表。</p><code>v1.3.0-engine-v2.86.0-2260f01e</code></article>
        </div>
        <p class="evidence-note">磁碟另留存 Engine Lab v2.46–2.50／2.54、Gameplay v1.0–1.2 與 Character v2.9.1／其他 v2.10 generations；它們在此僅列為歷史可追溯目錄，不作目前來源通過證據。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="showcase-section" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="micro-label">DEVELOPMENT TIMELINE</p><h2 id="timeline-title">已驗證切片與目前待驗收工作</h2><p>測試收據（receipt）記錄來源、退出碼與證據。CPU 測試不能代替 GPU（顯示卡）渲染、11 個固定鏡頭（11-shot）影像與人體動作驗收。下方歷史切片的通過範圍不自動延伸到目前候選。</p></div>
        <div class="showcase-filters" role="group" aria-label="開發切片篩選"><button type="button" data-stage-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button><button type="button" data-stage-filter="released" aria-pressed="false">含發布成果</button><button type="button" data-stage-filter="wip" aria-pressed="false">驗證中 WIP</button></div>
